          "type": "llm_conversation",
          "label": "LLM",
          "category": "logic",
          "icon": "MessagesSquare",
          "description": "One or two AI personas. Single persona = Q&A assistant (opening → response). Two personas = debate/dialogue for N turns. Each persona has its own provider, model and system prompt. API keys are saved locally. Supports Ollama (local/cloud), OpenAI, Anthropic, Groq, DeepSeek, Custom.",
